The name works harder than most regulars do — it is the last stop of the night, yes, but also the last stop on the border, the final pint before you cross into or out of the country. The [[Helmstier]] bar is kept by a half-elven barkeep whose expressions suggest he has heard every possible gloss on the joke and is done with all of them.
